    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722770/extras/aedeed2e4cde398d53642bddc5161d71.avif?t=1744983995\" /></div><br><br>Hello! We want to meet you! There are different animal girls among us, we live in different biomes, and we have different habits and characters. Someone is gentle, and it is better not to get close to someone. Who do you like the most?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHARACTERS</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722770/extras/300637fb4e87969ea71e4da945932deb.avif?t=1744983995\" /></div><br>Milk girl<br>Height: 166 cm<br>Three sizes: B97 / W58 / H93<br>Birthday July 5<br>Herbivorous<br>Habitat - Fields<br>Favorite food - Grass, oats.<br>TEMPER<br>Hi! I'm a very gentle girl, really, really! I really like to lie in the sun on the juicy grass and soak\u2026 Juicy grass by the way, this is my weakness\u2026 And in the morning, you will always have a glass of warm milk!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722770/extras/8ad97b64c2b1b6450c93f75e59b44a5a.avif?t=1744983995\" /></div><br>Tropical girl<br>Height: 166 cm<br>Three sizes: B97 / W58 / H93<br>Birthday December 11<br>Herbivorous<br>Habitat - Jungle<br>Favorite food - Bananas, leaves.<br>TEMPER<br>I am very playful and energetic! I can play, run and jump all day long! Come on, catch up with me\u2026 What, don't you want? Also tell me that you don't climb trees!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722770/extras/77553deccf0c521a968c9f59e74c1b18.avif?t=1744983995\" /></div><br>Snow leopard<br>Height: 166 cm<br>Three sizes: B97 / W58 / H93<br>Birthday April 29<br>Predator<br>Habitat - Taiga<br>Favorite food - Meat, fish.<br>TEMP